# The safety layer: precise about danger, honest about outcomes
register lv1

# 1. Bleach + ammonia → chloramine gas (existing rule)
add v1 water 200mL
add v1 NaOCl 0.1mol
add v1 NH3 0.1mol
measure v1 balance

# 2. Strong oxidizer + flammable liquid → fire risk
new
add v2 KMnO4 0.01mol
add v2 ethanol 50mL

# 3. Strong acid + active metal → hydrogen gas
new
add v3 water 100mL
add v3 HCl 0.1mol
add v3 Mg 0.05mol

# 4. Strong acid + carbonate → CO₂ spattering
new
add v4 water 100mL
add v4 HCl 0.1mol
add v4 CaCO3 0.05mol
